{'symbol': 'RF', 'date': '2022-11-28 09:00:00', 'title': 'REGIONS BANK LAUNCHES MULTI-ASSETS SOLUTIONS GROUP, COMBINING INVESTMENT RESEARCH STRENGTHS OF REGIONS AND HIGHLAND ASSOCIATES', 'text': "BIRMINGHAM, ALA.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--REGIONS BANK ON MONDAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS MULTI-ASSETS SOLUTIONS GROUP, THE RESULT OF COMBINING THE BANK'S INVESTMENT RESEARCH GROUP WITH THE RESEARCH TEAM FROM REGIONS SUBSIDIARY HIGHLAND ASSOCIATES."}